n a third-party _______ for our logistics.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 software _______ = szoftver sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. Choosing the right software _______ is crucial for our operations.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 street _______ = utcai \u00e1rus (pl. The street _______ offered delicious hot dogs.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 preferred _______ = prefer\u00e1lt sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. They are our preferred _______ for office supplies.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>vendor<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>vendor<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: vendor agreement \/ vendor management \/ vendor relationship \/ vendor selection<\/span><\/p><p>similar: seller \/ supplier \/ merchant \/ dealer<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: buyer \/ customer \/ purchaser<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-09T09:45:12+00:00"},{"id":51291,"front":"<p>He climbed the _______ to reach the top shelf in the garage. <em>(l\u00e9tra \/ fell\u00e9p\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s rapid growth allowed employees to quickly move up the career _______. <em>(rangl\u00e9tra \/ el\u0151meneteli lehet\u0151s\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p>Firefighters used a long extension _______ to rescue the cat from the tree. <em>(kitolhat\u00f3 l\u00e9tra \/ hossz\u00fa l\u00e9tra)<\/em><\/p><p>The social _______ in many societies makes it difficult for individuals to improve their status. <em>(t\u00e1rsadalmi rangl\u00e9tra \/ t\u00e1rsadalmi hierarchia)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">l\u00e9tra \/ rangl\u00e9tra \/ fell\u00e9p\u0151<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): lejt\u0151 \/ s\u00fcllyed\u00e9s \/ visszal\u00e9p\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 climb a _______ = l\u00e9tr\u00e1t m\u00e1szik (pl. Be careful when you climb a _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 extension _______ = kitolhat\u00f3 l\u00e9tra (pl. We need an extension _______ to paint the high wall.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 social _______ = t\u00e1rsadalmi rangl\u00e9tra (pl. Moving up the social _______ can be challenging.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 career _______ = karrierl\u00e9tra (pl. She&#039;s quickly moving up the career _______ at her company.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 rope _______ = k\u00f6t\u00e9ll\u00e9tra (pl. The ship had a rope _______ for emergencies.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>ladder<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>ladder<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: climb a ladder \/ extension ladder \/ social ladder \/ career ladder<\/span><\/p><p>similar: steps \/ stairs \/ stairway \/ rung<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: descent \/ slide \/ decline<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-09T09:45:17+00:00"},{"id":51290,"front":"<p>I need to buy new computer _______ for my gaming PC, especially a better graphics card. <em>(sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9p alkatr\u00e9szek \/ fizikai eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k)<\/em><\/p><p>The company specializes in developing innovative software solutions, but they also provide the necessary _______ infrastructure. <em>(fizikai berendez\u00e9sek \/ eszk\u00f6zpark)<\/em><\/p><p>Before installing the operating system, ensure all the _______ components are correctly connected and recognized. <em>(fizikai r\u00e9szegys\u00e9gek \/ g\u00e9pi elemek)<\/em><\/p><p>The museum exhibit showcased the evolution of early computing _______, from vacuum tubes to integrated circuits. <em>(g\u00e9pi eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k \/ fizikai komponensek)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">hardver \/ vas \/ g\u00e9pi berendez\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szoftver \/ program \/ alkalmaz\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 computer _______ = sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9p hardver (pl. Upgrading your computer _______ can significantly improve performance.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 network _______ = h\u00e1l\u00f3zati hardver (pl. We need to install new network _______ to support the increased traffic.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 install _______ = hardvert telep\u00edt (pl. It&#039;s easy to install new _______ if you follow the instructions.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ components = hardver komponensek (pl. All the _______ components must be compatible for the system to work.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>hardware<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>hardware<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: computer hardware \/ network hardware \/ hardware components \/ hardware failure<\/span><\/p><p>similar: equipment \/ machinery \/ components \/ gear<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: software \/ firmware \/ applications<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-09T09:36:48+00:00"},{"id":51292,"front":"<p>I need to take out a _______ from the bank to buy a new car. <em>(k\u00f6lcs\u00f6n \/ hitelt)<\/em><\/p><p>The library offers a free book _______ service to its members. <em>(k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nz\u00e9s \/ k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nad\u00e1si)<\/em><\/p><p>The government approved a substantial _______ to the developing nation for infrastructure projects. <em>(hitelt \/ k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nt)<\/em><\/p><p>Can I _______ you my umbrella? It looks like it&#039;s going to rain. <em>(k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nadom \/ odaadom)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00f6lcs\u00f6n \/ hitel \/ k\u00f6lcs\u00f6n\u00f6z<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): visszafizet\u00e9s \/ visszat\u00e9r\u00edt\u00e9s \/ adom\u00e1ny<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 take out a _______ = k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nt felvenni (pl. I had to take out a loan to pay for my studies.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 apply for a _______ = k\u00f6lcs\u00f6n\u00e9rt folyamodni (pl. Many students apply for a loan to cover tuition fees.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 repay a _______ = k\u00f6lcs\u00f6nt visszafizetni (pl. It&#039;s important to repay a loan on time.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 interest-free _______ = kamatmentes k\u00f6lcs\u00f6n (pl. Some companies offer an interest-free loan to their employees.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 personal _______ = szem\u00e9lyi k\u00f6lcs\u00f6n (pl. He took out a personal loan for home renovations.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>loan<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>loan<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>loan<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: bank loan \/ student loan \/ car loan \/ home loan<\/span><\/p><p>similar: credit \/ advance \/ mortgage \/ lend<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: debt \/ gift \/ grant<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-09T09:51:01+00:00"},{"id":51293,"front":"<p>The old Hollywood star lived in a sprawling _______ with a swimming pool and tennis courts. <em>(kast\u00e9ly \/ palota)<\/em><\/p><p>After years of hard work, they finally achieved their dream of owning a grand _______ in the countryside. <em>(villa \/ k\u00faria)<\/em><\/p><p>The historic _______, now a museum, offers a glimpse into the opulent lifestyle of the 19th-century aristocracy. <em>(rezidencia \/ f\u0151\u00fari h\u00e1z)<\/em><\/p><p>He inherited a vast fortune and a magnificent ancestral _______, which he struggled to maintain. <em>(nemesi k\u00faria \/ nagym\u00e9ret\u0171 h\u00e1z)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kast\u00e9ly \/ villa \/ palota<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): kunyh\u00f3 \/ visk\u00f3 \/ kis h\u00e1z<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a sprawling _______ = egy terjedelmes kast\u00e9ly\/villa (pl. They bought a sprawling _______ on the outskirts of the city.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 an ancestral _______ = egy \u0151si kast\u00e9ly\/k\u00faria (pl. The family has owned the ancestral _______ for generations.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a grand _______ = egy nagyszer\u0171 kast\u00e9ly\/villa (pl. She always dreamed of living in a grand _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a historic _______ = egy t\u00f6rt\u00e9nelmi kast\u00e9ly\/palota (pl. The historic _______ is now open to the public.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>mansion<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>mansion<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: sprawling mansion \/ ancestral mansion \/ grand mansion \/ historic mansion<\/span><\/p><p>similar: villa \/ palace \/ estate \/ hall<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: hut \/ shack \/ cottage<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-09T09:37:09+00:00"},{"id":51287,"front":"<p>Please _______ of your waste responsibly by using the recycling bins provided. <em>(megszabadul \/ eldob \/ kidob)<\/em><\/p><p>The company decided to _______ of its non-essential assets to reduce debt. <em>(elad \/ \u00e9rt\u00e9kes\u00edt \/ megszabadul)<\/em><\/p><p>He was able to _______ of the problem quickly and efficiently. <em>(megold \/ elint\u00e9z \/ rendez)<\/em><\/p><p>The general will _______ his troops for battle at dawn. <em>(elrendez \/ fel\u00e1ll\u00edt \/ csatarendbe \u00e1ll\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">megszabadul \/ elrendez \/ elad<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megtart \/ meg\u0151riz \/ beszerez<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of something = megszabadul valamit\u0151l (pl. We need to dispose of these old documents.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of waste = hullad\u00e9kot elhelyez\/kidob (pl. How do you dispose of hazardous waste?)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of assets = vagyont\u00e1rgyakat elad\/megszabadul t\u0151l\u00fck (pl. The firm plans to dispose of its foreign assets.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of a problem = megold egy probl\u00e9m\u00e1t (pl. He quickly disposed of the minor issue.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>dispose<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>disposable<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>disposal<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>dispose<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: dispose of \/ waste dispose \/ assets dispose \/ properly dispose<\/span><\/p><p>similar: discard \/ get rid of \/ sell \/ arrange<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: keep \/ retain \/ acquire<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"la